# Experiment Roadmap

Queue of experiments for <PROJECT NAME>, ranked by expected value.
Engineering chores belong in `TODO.md`; this file holds work whose output
is a *conclusion* (plus the research-adjacent machinery that unblocks it).

> **For agents**: every active item needs `payoff:` (with units!) and
> `cat:` (`research`/`engineering`/`data`/`tooling`/`infra`); add
> `depends-on: F-xxx` when the item's priority assumes a ledger finding.
> After any finding is overturned, run the skill's `retriage.py` and re-sort
> flagged items with the user. Syntax: skill's `references/tag-schema.md`.

