## P1

Highest expected value given current findings — would start today.

- [ ] **[S] Example item** — replace me (payoff: +X units on metric Y; cat: research)

## P2

Worth running, not next.

## P3

Someday — usually parked behind a dependency or a cheaper proxy.

## P?

Cannot be priced yet; needs a spike (tag `[?/Effort]`), or the idea is
still fuzzy. Vaguer sparks than this go to `backlog/inbox.md`.

## Done

Concluded experiments, newest first. Keep forever — this is the queue's
audit trail. Link the experiment id and the findings it produced.

- ✅ [2026-01-01] [P1/M] Example concluded item → #000 (F-000)
